        "description": "Selection is state and not history (RULE-10), so the command records no event and the answer is the basket the new selection prices (VIEW-1): ship it, the shipment's rows change the totals; ship it for the whole basket, every row does. Deselecting everything is a valid basket with an empty selection — the refusal lives at the handover, not here (RULE-9). Like every route that answers basket content it pulls before it answers (D66), so the rows it returns are the catalog's current answer, not the one they were added with — which is what makes step 15 of the contract possible without a transport. A basket owned by another customer answers 404 BASKET_NOT_FOUND (D68).",
